## Maintaining this README

Edit `README.md.src`, then run `pnpm readme:write`: mdtheme composes the file
from this source, the family frame (`packages/family/markdown/ferramenta/`,
generated by `pnpm theme:write`) and the company theme. `mise install --locked`
once, first; the commands are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).
